    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN301 · Chapter 5 · Session 15</span>\n<h2>Session 15 — Chapter 7: Bond Markets</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14260 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN301 · Chương 5 · Buổi 15</span>\n<h2>Buổi 15 — Chapter 7: Bond Markets</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14260 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 7: Bond Markets<br>7.3. Municipal bonds<br>7.4. Corporate bonds</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Book, Slides</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Complete assigned readings in advance and prepare key questions or reflections.<br>- Actively participate in discussions by presenting reasoned arguments, responding to peers, and engaging in constructive debate.<br>- Take structured notes and identify areas requiring further clarification or deeper analysis.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Group 1 - Discussion and Exercise chapter 16</strong> — **1. Interpret the following statement**:<br><br>“Our use of currency futures has completely changed our risk–return profile.”<br><br>**2. Currency Futures**<br>Use the following information to determine the probability distribution of per unit gains from selling Mexican peso futures.<br><br>■■ The spot rate of the peso is USD0.10.<br><br>■■ The price of peso futures is USD0.102 per unit.<br><br>■■ Your expectation of the peso spot rate at maturity of the futures contract can be found in &quot;Part 5 - Question for group reports (Chap 13-16)&quot; in Google Classroom.</li>\n<li><strong>Group 2 - Discussion and Exercise chapter 16</strong> — **1. Interpret the following statement**:<br><br>“Our use of currency options resulted in an upgrade in our credit rating.”<br><br>**2. Currency Call Options**<br><br>Use the following information to determine the probability distribution of net gains per unit from purchasing a call option on British pounds.<br><br>■■ The spot rate of the British pound is USD1.45.<br><br>■■ The premium on the British pound option is USD0.04 per unit.<br><br>■■ The exercise price of a British pound option is USD1.46.<br><br>■■ Your expectation of the British pound spot rate prior to the expiration of the option can be found in &quot;Part 5 - Question for group reports (Chap 13-16)&quot; in Google Classroom.</li>\n<li><strong>Group 3 - Discussion and Exercise chapter 16</strong> — **1. Interpret the following statement**:<br><br>“Our strategy of using forward contracts to hedge backfired on us.”<br><br>**4. Covered Interest Arbitrage**<br><br>Assume the following information:<br><br>■■ British pound spot rate = USD1.58<br><br>■■ British pound one-year forward rate = USD1.58<br><br>■■ British one-year interest rate = 11 percent<br><br>■■ U.S. one-year interest rate = 9 percent<br><br>Explain how U.S. investors could use covered interest arbitrage to lock in a higher yield than 9 percent. What would be their yield? Explain how the spot and forward rates of the pound would change as covered interest arbitrage occurs.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
