    "description": "Essay test 15.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN301 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Essay test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14260 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN301 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Essay test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14260 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">In class (45-60 minutes)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Multiple choice questions and/or Criticial thinking (exercises) questions</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP 1- Only MCQ: 40-50 questionsOP 2- Only Critical thinking questions/ Exercises : 3-4 question. OP 3- Mix: 15-20 mcqs + 2-3 critical thinking questions/exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Cover chapters 3, 6, 10, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 19 in form of:* Only MCQ: 40-50 questions* Only Critical thinking questions/ Exercises : 4-5 question. * Mix: 15-20 mcqs + 2-3 critical thinking questions/exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Paper/computer-based testing</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The questions are representative of chapter materials. Students are required to read the textbook. The Final essay accounts for 15% of the final score.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 18 — Progress Test (Chapters 1, 2, 3, 6)</li><li>Session 33 — Midterm Test (Chapters 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 10, 12, 13, 14) – 2 periods</li><li>Session 34 — Midterm Test (Chapters 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 10, 12, 13, 14) – 2 periods</li><li>Session 54 — Essay test Review &amp; Practice</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 18 — Progress Test (Chapters 1, 2, 3, 6)</li><li>Buổi 33 — Midterm Test (Chapters 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 10, 12, 13, 14) – 2 periods</li><li>Buổi 34 — Midterm Test (Chapters 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 10, 12, 13, 14) – 2 periods</li><li>Buổi 54 — Essay test Review &amp; Practice</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
